{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04664","headline":"广州萧都督入朝过岳州宴饯得冬字 · 张说","name":"广州萧都督入朝过岳州宴饯得冬字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤城抱大江，节使往朝宗。\n果是台中旧，依然水上逢。\n京华遥比日，疲老飒如冬。\n窃羡能言鸟，衔恩向九重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}